ms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Not recorded Whitney Archive. Downtown Gallery Archive dates 1930. Abiquiú Notebooks dates 1937. Dated 1937 on basis of inclusion in 1937–38 exhibition. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"11 7/8 x 10 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Terra Foundation for American Art, Gift of Mrs. Henrietta Roig","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 11 7/8 x 10 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"The artist \nThe Downtown Gallery, New York, New York \nThe Mayo Hill Galleries, Inc., Delray Beach, Florida \nMrs. Henrietta Roig, Winnetka, Illinois, 1953 \nTerra Foundation for the Arts Collection, Chicago, Illinois, 1984 (gift of Mrs. Henrietta Roig, Winnetka, Illinois) \n(Source: Terra Foundation for American Art, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"The supple, bright red petals of an amaryllis flower fill the frame. A single bright green leaf pokes into the top of the composition. The plant contrasts with a bright yellow background.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_a